[00:29.50]But can they do it for 24 hours and 30 minutes without stopping?
[00:36.92]Nikolai can and it's a world record!
[00:42.37]Sloan Henderson, from Utah, is a really good snowboarder – and she's only 14 months old!
[00:52.84]Her mother and father take her to the mountains, and they put her on a snowboard – and there she goes!
[01:02.12]Sloan loves to be on the board.
[01:05.46]People are often surprised when they see her because she doesn't fall over!
[01:12.01]American rock-climber Maureen 'Mo' Beck was born without her left hand and only part of her left arm, but she can climb really well.
[01:27.99]She is the winner of two climbing World Championships for disabled athletes, and five national championships.
[01:37.89]She has her own special way of climbing, but Maureen thinks she is just the same as any other climber.
[01:49.45]Goatee can't talk or write, but she can surf!
